# Pending Tasks

</div>

<div align = "justify">

The open tasks of the project. A coding agent can take one up, and a task may also carry an issue or a pull request. A
task file is removed only when every item of its "Done When" list holds, tests included, and git history keeps it. A gap
that still needs the owner's decision is in [gaps-and-risks.md](../gaps-and-risks.md), not here.

